<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish August non-EU exports 740.5 mln punts - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish August non-EU exports 740.5 mln punts - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's exports to countries outside the European Union fell to a seasonally adjusted 740.5 million Irish pounds in August from 825.0 million Irish pounds in July, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said.</p>
<p>Imports from non-EU countries fell to a seasonally adjusted 594.8 million Irish pounds from 693.0 million Irish pounds in July, the CSO said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
